e","url":"https://runwayml.com/news/company-news/praxis-1-is-now-available"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/r8hsm3m3munjwk1n3u885zszw","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"r8hsm3m3munjwk1n3u885zszw","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/r8hsm3m3munjwk1n3u885zszw","published_at":"2026-11-11T18:00:00Z","ref":"A4","score":69,"selected":true,"source":"Google Blog：AI（RSS）","summary":"Google 推出 Gemini Decisions API，由新模型 Gemini Decision 1 驱动，可在 150-250ms 端到端延迟内对文本、图像、音频、视频和 PDF（最多 256K tokens）一次性评估最多 1000 个是/否、多选和评分题。","title":"Google 发布 Gemini Decisions API 与 Gemini Decision 1 模型，专注快速多模态封闭式决策","title_en":"Gemini Decisions API: Fast, calibrated multimodal decisions","url":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-decisions-api/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ep5oqt7m4l7gn3tqieilznmuk","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"ep5oqt7m4l7gn3tqieilznmuk","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ep5oqt7m4l7gn3tqieilznmuk","published_at":"2026-11-11T17:30:20Z","ref":"A5","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"Claude：YouTube（RSS）","summary":"Claude 发布视频教程，讲解在 Claude Code 中何时使用 Fable 5.2、Opus 5.5，何时降级到 Sonnet 5.5 或 Haiku 5.5，以及如何把一个任务拆分给多个模型。视频覆盖复杂编码与开放式技术工作、低成本明确任务等场景，并提供在自有任务上测量各模型表现的指南链接；可用性与用量限制因套餐而异。","title":"Claude Code 中如何选择 Fable 5.2 与 Opus 等模型","title_en":"Fable 5.2 or Opus? When to use each model in Claude Code","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C33hJGt-ySg"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/bisaluc0ii0f4s1gzi2zxbr1k","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"bisaluc0ii0f4s1gzi2zxbr1k","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/bisaluc0ii0f4s1gzi2zxbr1k","published_at":"2026-11-11T15:02:38Z","ref":"A6","score":62,"selected":true,"source":"a16z：News（RSS）","summary":"a16z 发布文章提出 B2A 经济概念，认为 AI 智能体已占大多数网络流量，正从回答问题转向代替用户完成任务和消费。","title":"a16z 提出 B2A 经济：AI 智能体正成为新的流量与分发渠道","title_en":"Welcome to the B2A Economy","url":"https://www.a16z.news/p/welcome-to-the-b2a-economy"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/r5kn7uexy6jx97qwxwvnpqrom","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"r5kn7uexy6jx97qwxwvnpqrom","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/r5kn7uexy6jx97qwxwvnpqrom","published_at":"2026-11-11T14:38:51Z","ref":"A7","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"Bloomberg 报道 Anthropic IPO 已获数倍于发行份额的订单，主要来自大型机构投资者的锚定级意向。公司通过 IPO 加私募配售寻求最高 $90.4B，将超过 SpaceX 的 $85.7B 纪录成为史上最大上市，完全稀释估值目标约 $1.4T；Goldman Sachs 和 Morgan Stanley 牵头共 22 家银行，股票将以 ANT 在纳斯达克全球精选市场交易。","title":"Anthropic IPO 拟募资最高 90.4B 美元，或成史上最大上市","title_en":"Bloomberg: Anthropic’s IPO has drawn orders for several times the shares available, mostly from anchor-size indications of interest (i.e....","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2120526677247939001"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/iz168hjk4ew8jpiokzjqcwbgi","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"iz168hjk4ew8jpiokzjqcwbgi","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/iz168hjk4ew8jpiokzjqcwbgi","published_at":"2026-11-11T13:56:44.467000Z","ref":"A8","score":86,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家·人工智能","summary":"据彭博社报道，多名未成年受害者就 Grok 被用于把普通照片篡改成儿童性虐待材料（CSAM）对马斯克旗下 xAI 提起多起集体诉讼，律师估计符合索赔条件的受害者可能多达数千人。","title":"Grok 被指生成儿童色情图像，xAI 面临多起集体诉讼","title_en":"马斯克旗下 Grok 被指生成儿童色情图像，xAI 面临多起集体诉讼","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/025/809.htm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/wlmgb3vb5ycgom7wq44felnin","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"wlmgb3vb5ycgom7wq44felnin","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/wlmgb3vb5ycgom7wq44felnin","published_at":"2026-11-11T12:53:07Z","ref":"A9","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","summary":"安全公司 Claroc 报告称，在检查的 37,571 个仍在线的 Grok 构建应用中，35,578 个（94.7%）无需登录即可访问，原因是发布对话框默认预选\"Anyone with the link\"，且每个应用的独立子域名会进入可检索的 passive DNS 数据库。","title":"安全公司 Claroc：94.7% 的 Grok 构建应用可被任意访问，含患者数据和 SpaceXSI 内部文件","title_en":"Grok-built apps exposed patient data, plaintext passwords, and