 和 Google 达成超 100 亿美元的新协议。Microsoft 承诺到 2033 年 6 月支出至少 472 亿、最高 492 亿美元，Google 最低承诺从约 1145 亿升至约 1213 亿美元，两笔均不可撤销、无论是否使用容量都须付款。文件还提到上季度短期算力支出 50 亿美元且价格明显更高。","title":"Anthropic 修订版 S1 文件披露与 Microsoft 和 Google 超 100 亿美元级新算力协议","title_en":"Anthropic reveals in its amended S1 filing today, more than $10 billion in new agreements with Microsoft and Google.","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2120369586096976098"}],"counts":{"aihot_published":12,"aihot_upstream":12,"trendradar_matched":33,"trendradar_published":33,"trendradar_raw":416},"generated_at":"2026-11-12T11:19:09+08:00","report_date":"2026-11-12","run_id":"20261112T111909+0800","schema_version":1,"source_status":{"aihot":{"api_version":"2.0.0","page_count":1,"status":"live"},"trendradar":{"platform_count":11,"snapshot_count":2,"status":"live"}},"timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","trendradar_items":[{"crawl_count":1,"first_crawl_time":"2026-11-12T00:30:57+08:00","id":"f12808b8fbd4ee15566a5641","last_crawl_time":"2026-11-12T00:30:57+08:00","platform":"澎湃新闻","platform_id":"thepaper","rank":1,"rank_change":0,"ref":"N1","title":"专访项飙：当AI成为“不需要水的鱼”，人类如何重新理解自己和生活","url":"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34440595"},{"crawl_count":1,"first_crawl_time":"2026-11-12T11:18:25+08:00","id":"1e6a98df919af325555e59a6","last_crawl_time":"2026-11-12T11:18:25+08:00","platform":"华尔街见闻","platform_id":"wallstreetcn-hot","rank":1,"rank_change":0,"ref":"N2","title":"黄仁勋再曝新婚外情，董事会准备罢免！英伟达盘后跌幅达8%","url":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785765"},{"crawl_count":1,"first_crawl_time":"2026-11-12T11:18:25+08:00","id":"118a49dc335afeb1e409d90b","last_crawl_time":"2026-11-12T11:18:25+08:00","platform":"bilibili 热搜","platform_id":"bilibili-hot-search","rank":2,"rank_change":0,"ref":"N3","title":"AI离完全证明千禧难题还有多远","url":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=AI%E7%A6%BB%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E5%8D%83%E7%A6%A7%E9%9A%BE%E9%A2%98%E8%BF%98%E6%9C%89%E5%A4%9A%E8%BF%9C"},{"crawl_count":1,"first_crawl_time":"2026-11-12T11:18:25+08: